      "worked_solution": "Green's theorem states that\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/accf185e064f4c9c99cc6ad1437aabc7d5471cc332ff6c38d51a3f11ec6e26f2.svg)\n\nIn our case, the region ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/5914524b1d3db63c66998b75ca1d00a5dc4e294d2a8f10fe384d2b2ebf2af38e.svg) and its boundary ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/c0c348883f19c18a48444415da35aeaa27f8a18606bf5955e34aec416e248cad.svg) satisfy the conditions of Green's theorem.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/6706cc6b412a98761f0f3cd29e584f1705fa8a708a926b805a8b5702a4f508e8.png)\n\nNow, since\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/8cbe1833f3c6f1612d69aecc8354e66cbf24ef426d648ed5c90224bbcf5ab341.svg)\nwe obtain\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/01e3a66875647bfc9704bc6a1066dbc18c5cf1c0b0144aff8eb2e478685f83d2.svg)\n\nApplying Green's theorem, we get\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/493f02d8a665f5b2dedf5ab543475a28b82bc393d3290a60250d26fbb8065b01.svg)\n\nNow, notice that the region ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/5914524b1d3db63c66998b75ca1d00a5dc4e294d2a8f10fe384d2b2ebf2af38e.svg) can be represented in polar coordinates as\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/2c2141d090d129fde56fdfd334e4162927db247703b7ecd62eb14261340ac929.svg)\n\nThe change of variables formula for plane polar coordinates states that\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/19dfe81d2ed118fd87e4e0ac483119e68f4bbf5ec67ccbaf2614360015ff193a.svg)\n\nFinally, we can calculate our double integral, as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/0c7d035d915ae4a4cc993d476824897130b85797f32ad753f86e1accd1d5e29e.svg)",
